    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-consumer-protection-act-2014-sch-1-sec-119b-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "119B(5) Publication requirements for submissions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-consumer-protection-act-2014#sch-1-sec-119b-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-consumer-protection-act-2014.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-consumer-protection-act-2014.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If, under subsection (4), the body or association removes material\nfrom a submission before publishing the submission on its website,\nthe body or association must publish on its website a statement to\nthe effect that confidential or commercially sensitive material in\nthe submission has not been published.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2014A00003\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If, under subsection (4), the body or association removes material\nfrom a submission before publishing the submission on its website,\nthe body or association must publish on its website a statement to\nthe effect that confidential or commercially sensitive material in\nthe submission has not been published.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2014A00003\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-consumer-protection-act-2014-sch-1-sec-119b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-consumer-protection-act-2014-sch-1-sec-119b-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-consumer-protection-act-2014-sch-1-sec-119b-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1caf38814d81ec77495d042dfe818878ddc00af78c85ac5b9c73180cffca7ff7",
      "skos:note": "Publish statement if material is removed from submission before publishing",
      "dc:description": "statement to the effect that confidential or commercially sensitive material has not been published"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-consumer-protection-act-2014#sch-1-sec-119b-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "119B(5) Publication requirements for submissions",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 12,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If, under subsection (4), the body or association removes material\nfrom a submission before publishing the submission on its website,\nthe body or association must publish on its website a statement to\nthe effect that confidential or commercially sensitive material in\nthe submission has not been published.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2014A00003\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments"
    },
