      "values:originalText": "After “declaration in relation to”, insert “the development of”.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2014A00003\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-consumer-protection-act-2014-sch-1-sec-24-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
