      "values:originalText": "After “developing the code”, insert “or varying the code, as the case\nmay be,”.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2014A00003\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nTelecommunications Industry Ombudsman scheme  Part 2\n\nNo. 3, 2014\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Consumer Protection)\nAct 2014",
