      "skos:definition": "(7) The Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman must:\n\n(a) give a copy of the report to the Minister; and\n\n(b) publish the report on the Telecommunications Industry\nOmbudsman’s website.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2014A00003\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nTelecommunications Industry Ombudsman scheme  Part 2\n\nNo. 3, 2014\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Consumer Protection)\nAct 2014\n\nResponse to recommendations in report",
