    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-consumer-protection-act-2014-sch-1-sec-133a-ss-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "133A(8) Reviews of the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-consumer-protection-act-2014#sch-1-sec-133a-ss-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-consumer-protection-act-2014.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-consumer-protection-act-2014.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "(8) If a report of a review sets out one or more recommendations to the\nTelecommunications Industry Ombudsman, the\nTelecommunications Industry Ombudsman must, within 6 months\nafter receiving the report:\n\n(a) prepare a statement setting out the Telecommunications\nIndustry Ombudsman’s response to each of the\nrecommendations; and\n\n(b) publish a copy of the statement on the Telecommunications\nIndustry Ombudsman’s website; and\n\n(c) give a copy of the statement to the Minister.\nCompletion of review",
      "skos:definition": "(8) If a report of a review sets out one or more recommendations to the\nTelecommunications Industry Ombudsman, the\nTelecommunications Industry Ombudsman must, within 6 months\nafter receiving the report:\n\n(a) prepare a statement setting out the Telecommunications\nIndustry Ombudsman’s response to each of the\nrecommendations; and\n\n(b) publish a copy of the statement on the Telecommunications\nIndustry Ombudsman’s website; and\n\n(c) give a copy of the statement to the Minister.\nCompletion of review",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-consumer-protection-act-2014-sch-1-sec-133a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-consumer-protection-act-2014-sch-1-sec-133a-ss-8-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-consumer-protection-act-2014-sch-1-sec-133a-ss-8-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8c9e23d6042e25fe6322b4a601c814fad9f334cf6164dd658e1ba87ce2e4d4e8",
      "skos:note": "Must respond to recommendations within 6 months",
      "dc:description": "Statement and publication on website"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-consumer-protection-act-2014#sch-1-sec-133a-ss-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "133A(8) Reviews of the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 20,
      "values:originalText": "(8) If a report of a review sets out one or more recommendations to the\nTelecommunications Industry Ombudsman, the\nTelecommunications Industry Ombudsman must, within 6 months\nafter receiving the report:\n\n(a) prepare a statement setting out the Telecommunications\nIndustry Ombudsman’s response to each of the\nrecommendations; and\n\n(b) publish a copy of the statement on the Telecommunications\nIndustry Ombudsman’s website; and\n\n(c) give a copy of the statement to the Minister.\nCompletion of review"
    },
